 *
 * Set up a signal frame... Make the stack look the way SunOS
 * expects it to look which is basically:
 *
 * ---------------------------------- <-- %sp at signal time
 * Struct sigcontext
 * Signal address
 * Ptr to sigcontext area above
 * Signal code
 * The signal number itself
 * One register window
 * ---------------------------------- <-- New %sp
 */
